\b Noesis Thumbnails\b0\par
This package installs Windows Explorer thumbnail integration and a private copy of Noesis 4.474 for the current Windows user. No separate Noesis download, compiler, Python installation, or manual registration is needed.\par\par
Noesis is written by Rich Whitehouse. The original Noesis ReadMe.txt and all notices included in the supplied archive are preserved under the application's noesis directory. Third-party software remains subject to its respective terms. This installer does not grant additional redistribution rights to Noesis or its plugins.\par\par
Website: https://www.richwhitehouse.com/index.php?content=inc_projects.php&showproject=91\par\par
The installer registers supported model/image thumbnail extensions and saves existing per-user thumbnail handlers. Uninstall from Windows Settings > Apps restores the saved handlers where this application still owns the association, removes the bundled runtime, and clears this application's cache. It does not change the default application used to open your files.\par\par
Archives and animation-only files may not have renderable content. Support depends on the included Noesis readers and the availability of related asset files.\par
